        "original_id": "d6500a7a-dff3-528a-bb1b-c9412cd11fdc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adele Astaire, Allen Kearns\n- Works: \"'S Wonderful\", \"Funny Face\"\n- Roles: dancer, stage actress, singer\n\nFacts:\n- In 1927, the song \"'S Wonderful\" was introduced in the Broadway musical \"Funny Face\" by Adele Astaire and Allen Kearns.\n- Adele Astaire was born as Adele Marie Austerlitz on September 10, 1896.\n- Adele Astaire, later titled Lady Charles Cavendish, was an American dancer, stage actress, and singer.\n- Adele Astaire died on January 25, 1981.",
